Package: openmediavault-webui
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.6),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: new web interface for openmediavault
 A second web interface for openmediavault, served at /ui/ beside the
 stock one. It uses openmediavault's own backend and the same sign-in, so
 the same accounts, permissions and settings apply in both interfaces.
 .
 The package installs static files and one nginx snippet. It changes no
 openmediavault setting and adds no service, user or database entry.
 Removing it leaves the stock interface as it was.
